{%- comment -%}
  Our world: a huge fixed title over two staggered columns of tall pictures that drift at different speeds.
  Layout idea taken from the reference; every word, picture and shape here is nanzo's own.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>.ow{--s:url('{{ 'shell.png' | asset_url }}')}</style>
<section class="ow" data-ow>
  <h1 class="ow__title" aria-label="Our world"><span>OUR</span> <span>WORLD</span></h1>

  <div class="ow__grid">
    <div class="ow__col" data-par="0.04">
      <figure class="ow__t ow__t--tall" style="--img:url('{{ 'landing-i0.webp' | asset_url }}')"><figcaption>Love over trend</figcaption></figure>
      <div class="ow__txt"><p class="w">the “I have nothing to wear” moment</p><p>Every girl knows the feeling. The flights are booked, the invite is close, the wardrobe is full, and somehow there’s nothing to wear. Nanzo was born for that moment.</p></div>
      <figure class="ow__t ow__t--sq" style="--img:url('{{ 'landing-i3.webp' | asset_url }}')"><figcaption>Co-created with the girls of India</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="ow__t ow__t--arch" style="--g:linear-gradient(#FCB1C5,#FFFAF0)"><i></i><figcaption>The box</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="ow__t ow__t--tall" style="--img:url('{{ 'landing-i5.webp' | asset_url }}')"><figcaption>Raw shoot</figcaption></figure>
    </div>

    <div class="ow__col ow__col--b" data-par="-0.07">
      <figure class="ow__t ow__t--sq" style="--img:url('{{ 'landing-i1.webp' | asset_url }}')"><figcaption>Made for occasions</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="ow__t ow__t--tall" style="--img:url('{{ 'landing-i4.webp' | asset_url }}')"><figcaption>After Hours, drop 01</figcaption></figure>
      <div class="ow__txt"><p class="w">not for tuesdays</p><p>Birthdays, bachelorettes, vacations and the nights you’ll want photos of. Every print and silhouette is chosen because we’re in love with it, never because it’s trending.</p></div>
      <figure class="ow__t ow__t--sq" style="--img:url('{{ 'landing-i2.webp' | asset_url }}')"><figcaption>Tried on, talked about, reworked</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="ow__t ow__t--arch" style="--g:linear-gradient(#D9E8E1,#FFE9EF)"><i></i><figcaption>Nanzo currency</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ow__end">
    <h2 class="p">If nanzo were a person, she’d be the friend who plans the party.</h2>
    <p>Enthusiastic and dependable. Opinionated about taste. Inclusive, and fun with substance.</p>
    <a class="btn-brown" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Shop After Hours</a>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "Our world", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "Our world" }] }
{% endschema %}
